  "id": "Hackney-2024_0207",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The rear extension, by virtue of its scale, design and siting represents an incongruous and overdominant addition that fails to respond positively to the architectural character and appearance of the existing building, to the detriment of the existing building and resulting in less than substantial harm to the significance of the Kingsland and Regents Canal Conservation Areas. This harm would not be outweighed by any public benefits of the development.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;The development would, therefore, conflict with Policy HC1 of the London Plan (2021), Policy LP3 of the Hackney Local Plan (2020) and the National Planning Policy Framework (2024).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
